title: Fix gap sync stalls during ancestry search
doc:
- audience: [Node Operator, Node Dev]
  description: |-
    Fix stalls when a peer switches from downloading gap blocks to ancestry search.
    Clear stale gap sync state once the database gap is closed.
    Remove `remove_obsolete` from `SyncingAction::StartRequest`. Replaced requests
    must now be canceled explicitly with `CancelRequest`.
crates:
- name: sc-network-sync
  bump: major
  validate: false
